tory to Eli’s Student view and the authorized Morgan Family view in the authorized Student and Family views.</p><div class="action-row"><button class="action action-secondary" value="cancel">Cancel</button><button class="action action-primary" value="confirm" data-publish-confirm={record.id}>Confirm publication</button></div></form></dialog>}</>})()}
